  "invariants": [
    "Reprint creates new specimen; digital width update never alters physical specimen",
    "Forward and adjoint records pair only on same specimen, geometry version, trial and mapped bond IDs",
    "All changed strings/fixture/camera states require explicit new version and baseline policy",
    "Input record identity and evaluator label are separate from anonymous actor case token",
    "Independent trial count is not independent specimen count; source specimen allocation unknown",
    "Archive/transfer records preserve one current physical custody location",
